The results of \S\ref{sec:results}--\ref{sec:f6} establish CIVO as a failure mode triggered by trained temporal embeddings with multi-rate exposure. We now ask: can standard RL remedies eliminate it? We evaluate seven interventions across four levels (Table~\ref{tab:intervention_hierarchy}, Figure~\ref{fig:intervention_heatmap}); none reliably succeeds across environments.

\begin{figure}[t]
